<title>DUBAI: UAE 1995 M3 money supply grows yr/yr 11.4 pct.</title>
<headline>UAE 1995 M3 money supply grows yr/yr 11.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Arab Emirates M3 money supply rose 11.4 percent in 1995, M2 rose 10.2 percent and M1 grew 8.5 percent, UAE central bank figures show.</p>
<p>Detailed data (percentage change over one year):</p>
<p>		   December 1995	  December 1994</p>
<p> M3		  +11.4		    +3.9</p>
<p> M2		  +10.2		    +7.9</p>
<p> M1		  +8.5		     +5.5</p>
<p>Monetary aggregates (in millions of dirhams)</p>
<p>		   December 1995	  December 1994</p>
<p> M3		 103,493		    92,909</p>
<p> M2		  81,402		    73,883</p>
<p> M1		  20,824		    19,183</p>
<p>-- Dubai Newsroom, 9714-626990</p>
</text>
